Z||000000||The Fieromaster||09-28-2001||10:22 PM||||  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif">  For those of you who have heard the "Heres your sign" skit by i think(???) Jeff Foxworthy... It talks about idiot things and when ya do them ya get your "sign" (Jackass!)<BR><FONT SIZE="2"><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>SOOOOOOO!!</B></FONT></FONT><BR>Well i need my sign because... after fighting with my car and not being able to know whats wrong (sensors, leaks, shorts - checked it all) I have FOUND the problem with my cars POOOOR running....<BR>Well after I found that the "base" timing was way off it still ran poor so i put in a new distributor (just pulled off cap - not wires) and still no go... sooooo i checked compression and traced a wire to find that....<P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"><FONT SIZE="3"><B><FONT COLOR="red">The DAMN wires to plugs 5 & 4 were crossed!!</FONT></FONT></B> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"><P>DOH!!<P>Someone.. can you please find my "sign" i think i dropped it... I need it again!<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">        <FONT COLOR="red">"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">     <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif"">                <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AIM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT></B><p>[This message has been edited by The Fieromaster (edited 09-28-2001).]||||reg||11
